{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060257/block/singleImage/3248243/df/01M5V1791K7R6CVGFF4NDXTKXJ.jpeg?updatedAt=1792989902\"/><figcaption>元朗壆圍路貨倉員工被3狗追趕，遭1狗咬傷腳送院治理。(警方提供)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (26 日 ) 上午約 8 時，警方接獲一名男子報案，指他途經元朗壆圍路與壆圍西路交界時遭 3 隻狗追趕，期間更被其中1隻狗咬傷左邊小腿。 救援人員接報到場，該名26歲姓梁男子被送往博愛醫院治理。警方正調查事件起因，漁護署人員到場將涉事狗隻帶走檢查。 據了解，案發位置是一間名為 「祥興物流有限公司」的倉庫， 共飼養了3隻狗隻，涉事 狗隻是 6歲黃色唐狗， 活動範圍亦以貨倉內為主，而事主是貨倉員工， 準備上班途中時被狗隻襲擊 。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060257/block/singleImage/3248289/df/01M5V18CXSYQPWDXDM7XEHWVZY.jpeg?updatedAt=1792989902\"/><figcaption>元朗壆圍路貨倉員工被3狗追趕，遭1狗咬傷腳送院治理。(警方提供)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.524701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:08:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:16.543200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:06.325752+00:00","content_hash":"5c6583f3bb07f4c6c81cfa3af118558d5332c56b92065e1b5a893d62669e1af0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.524701+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}